{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act18side_level_act18side_08_end",
  "groupId": "act18side",
  "stageId": "act18side_08",
  "title": "命運",
  "storyCode": "LE-8",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f427caa469c371d64866896c0ff7dcebca6b43026f66b9d94a162f828e0d8a9e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "text": "傻孩子，真是個傻孩子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "text": "你明明可以不用做這樣的事的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "text": "這片大地欠你這麼多，你又何必做到這一步？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "老先生？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "請您趕快離開！這裡的源石活性正在不斷上升！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "text": "我還想見我孫子最後一面呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "就差最後一下了，芙蓉，拜託你牽制他的注意力——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "text": "白堊，爺爺在這。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "您？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "text": "白堊，我親愛的孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "text": "如果你覺得有怨氣，就衝我來吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "text": "在你毀掉更多東西之前，先衝我來吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "text": "我騙了你許多年，瞞了你許多年......我想過因你而死，卻沒想過你會遭遇這樣的結局！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "text": "既然你選擇讓其他人活下去，那就讓時日無多的我隨你而去，又有何妨？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "text": "讓我再陪你一程吧，我親愛的孩子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "源石結晶組成的怪物不能理解老人的話。\n剛剛那瞬間的清醒已經是奇跡中的奇跡，此時的怪物只想隨著大提琴聲，將四周拖入永久的虛無。\n於是，怪物循著聲音傳來的方向，全力噴吐死亡的旋律。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "老先生？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爺爺",
      "text": "小姑娘，你何必——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "——黑鍵，這裡由我擋住，趁現在！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "喝啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "text": "怎麼可能？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "text": "友情、犧牲、奉獻——如此幼稚的信念，就應該在現實中摔得粉身碎骨，憑什麼，憑什麼？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "text": "不，還沒有結束！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "text": "白堊確實把兩段塵世之音強行納入了自己這一側，可他最終還是敵不過它們疊加在一起的無序和瘋狂！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "text": "我聽得見，白堊的旋律已經消散殆盡，但黑鍵的塵世之音並未離去，我還——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "text": "唔呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "text": "夠了，斯特羅洛伯爵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "格特魯德剛剛搭上琴弦的手無力地垂下。\n別格勒把匕首從格特魯德的後背抽出，血染髒了他的衣服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "源石外殼層層崩解。\n廣場上失去了聲音，只有失去活性的源石外殼落在地上的沉悶響動。\n最後，外殼盡數剝落，留在原地的，是奄奄一息的白堊，還有他身邊的大提琴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "等著我......等著我！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "等等！他現在很危險，我們該做的是呼叫感染者臨終事務處......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "你說什麼？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "......白堊不會死的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "白堊，你醒了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "看到了嗎，白堊有救的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "黑鍵......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "我在這裡，我在這裡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "別......白費力氣了，我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "（深呼吸）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "我覺得......身體好輕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "剛剛一直很痛，但現在好多了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "嗯，會好的，肯定會好的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "聽好了，黑鍵，這是我最後一次跟你說話了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "記著我的話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "黑鍵，你要活下去，你要走過漫長的夜晚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "你要去反抗那些不公的命運，並且孜孜不倦地為他人付出。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "只有這樣，當你坐下來的時候，才會想到我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "我會問你，黑鍵，你今天過得如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "然後，你會挺起胸膛告訴我，你又度過了充實的一天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "你會向我傾訴你在行善過程中遭遇的障礙，以及抱怨命運始終不願青睞於你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "但是沒有關係，我會傾聽你的一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "因為你是那麼努力，你當然可以去抱怨一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "只有這樣，你才不會被這片大地上的苦痛所淹沒，你才能在你的生活中獲得安寧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "記著，黑鍵，我們曾經一同反抗了不公平的命，而我們得了勝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "所以，想到我的時候，你應當笑，而不是哭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "嗯，嗯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "還有，對不起啊，黑鍵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "我還沒有想好......應該給你什麼信物比較......好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "你送我什麼都可以的，求求你別死，求求你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "白堊，白堊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "白堊！！！！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "text": "他們總有一天會摔得粉身碎骨的，但不是現在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "text": "友情、犧牲、奉獻......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "text": "他們可能確實有些幼稚，但至少有人會為他們掬一把同情淚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "text": "但你呢，斯特羅洛伯爵？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "text": "你親手毀掉了自己和車爾尼之間萌生的友情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "text": "你殺掉了自己的親兄弟，還要嘲弄他的無能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "text": "你想讓別人為你奉獻，可你給了別人什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "text": "......實在太難看了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "text": "我承認自己剛剛有些衝動，但緊急處理威脅大眾安全的因素，這也是我的職責之一。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "text": "我會替你寫一份詳實的報告的，斯特羅洛伯爵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "text": "晚安，祝你做個不用詛咒別人的夢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "你的手在流血！難道是被源石結晶刺到了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "啊，好像......是出了點血。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "你得立刻接受必要的救治——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "救治？現在要救治的是白堊啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "黑鍵，他......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "別。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "別說那個詞，芙蓉，我求求你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "......好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "他......畢竟是感染者，黑鍵，就當是為他考慮，如果你不想聯繫感染者臨終事務處，至少找個密封性良好的房間......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "我明白，我明白......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "就......音樂廳休息室吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "好，我送他過去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "我去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "白堊，來，我抱你進去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑鍵小心翼翼地抱起白堊，身上被源石刺出更多傷口，但他無暇顧及。\n他抱著朋友慢慢失去溫度的身體，就像抱著一個短暫而美好的夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "白堊，我們馬上就到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "很快的，很快我們就到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊？",
      "text": "謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "你還——活著？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "我這就帶你出去，去找芙蓉——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊？",
      "text": "把我安頓在這座建築裡吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊？",
      "text": "如果你以後還能回到夕照區，你就會想起，你有一個很好很好的朋友，你和他在這裡爭吵過，歡笑過......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊？",
      "text": "最後，你和他共同獻上了一場精彩的合奏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "不對，你不是白堊，你是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊？",
      "text": "但這難道不是你想要的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "老頭，閉嘴，我不允許你這樣玷污他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "白堊為了清除塵世之音付出了生命，可塵世之音......還在我的腦子裡？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "我警告你，如果你還想模仿他，我不介意在這把自己的頭打爆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腦海中的聲音",
      "text": "（嘆息聲）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "腦海中的聲音",
      "text": "......我愚蠢的血脈啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "再沒有什麼聲音出現在黑鍵耳畔。\n他只是抱著白堊越來越沉重的身體，一步一步地朝夕照廳的休息室走去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "我們到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "我去做密封工作，你在沙發上躺好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "這裡的沙發挺軟的，你躺著一定很舒服——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "沙發、軟......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "你甚至沒睡過家裡的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "......我大概真是感染了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "以前要花點精力才能用的法術，現在幾乎不費勁。看來感染了也挺好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "好了，這樣就差不多了。門等我出去再封上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "還有......什麼願望嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "紀念......對了，紀念。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "那把大提琴，我就拿走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "我給你買的東西，現在我又要拿走，真是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑鍵的嘴唇動了動，沒說出話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他靜靜站立片刻，彎下腰，輕輕把自己用慣了的長笛放在白堊身邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "你之前說想要一個鑽了孔的硬幣，可我現在只剩這把長笛了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "對不起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "text": "對不起......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
